WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.544
In the gym at Monster Academy, the skeleton Boneyard Brass Band played on and on.

2
00:00:23.466 --> 00:00:25.868
The sounds drifted faintly toward the science lab.

3
00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:31.885
"I bet Winnie is dancing right now," Ben muttered to Waldo.

4
00:00:31.905 --> 00:00:37.308
"I bet she stopped looking for me, and now she's having fun with some other monster."

5
00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:39.169
He sighed.

6
00:00:41.431 --> 00:00:43.472
"I just hope it's not one of the football players.

7
00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:46.994
Or that troll who wears ties to school all the time."

8
00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:50.496
"I'll tell you what I want to know."

9
00:00:50.836 --> 00:00:53.538
Waldo stood up and went to look at his experiment again.

10
00:00:53.558 --> 00:00:56.720
"I want to know who tried to ruin my talk potion."

11
00:00:57.908 --> 00:01:01.690
"It was probably the same monster who locked us in here," Ben replied.

12
00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:06.332
"That same idiot who—" Just then the door flew open.

13
00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:12.354
Creepy!" Waldo burst out.

14
00:01:12.374 --> 00:01:15.656
"It's Friday night!

15
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.036
What are you doing here?"

16
00:01:18.297 --> 00:01:20.738
The teacher stared at the two boys in surprise.

17
00:01:20.758 --> 00:01:23.339
"I'm a chaperone at the dance.

18
00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:25.460
What are you two doing here?"

19
00:01:27.104 --> 00:01:29.806
"Somebody locked us in," Waldo explained quickly.

20
00:01:29.826 --> 00:01:34.228
"Oh, and by the way, someone also tried to ruin my talk potion."

21
00:01:35.248 --> 00:01:36.589
"What?" said Mr.

22
00:01:36.649 --> 00:01:39.671
Creepy. He strode to the back of the lab.

23
00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:42.572
"Who would do that?"

24
00:01:43.773 --> 00:01:45.694
Ben didn't wait to hear Waldo's answer.

25
00:01:45.714 --> 00:01:46.935
"Thanks, Mr.

26
00:01:47.015 --> 00:01:48.295
Creepy!" he shouted.

27
00:01:48.316 --> 00:01:49.516
"See you later!"

28
00:01:51.137 --> 00:01:52.818
He raced down the hall toward the gym.

29
00:01:53.999 --> 00:01:56.220
Inside the big room, the lights were dim.

30
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.501
Ben peered around for Winnie.

31
00:02:00.521 --> 00:02:03.743
"I hope she didn't leave," he thought.

32
00:02:08.425 --> 00:02:11.847
cried Gaby as Waldo rushed into the gym behind Ben.

33
00:02:11.867 --> 00:02:15.289
"Where were you two?

34
00:02:15.309 --> 00:02:16.850
I was so worried."

35
00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.532
"Sorry," said Waldo.

36
00:02:19.552 --> 00:02:21.773
"Somebody trapped us inside the lab."

37
00:02:21.793 --> 00:02:23.874
"That's awful!"

38
00:02:24.435 --> 00:02:25.055
said Gaby.

39
00:02:25.075 --> 00:02:30.905
"I wonder who Just then the band started playing a new song, and her eyes lit up.

40
00:02:30.925 --> 00:02:32.445
"Come on!"

41
00:02:32.846 --> 00:02:34.666
she said, grabbing Waldo's hand.

42
00:02:34.686 --> 00:02:36.787
"You're here now.

43
00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:38.327
Let's dance."

44
00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.068
Gaby and Waldo hurried off.

45
00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:46.149
Ben scanned the dance floor for Winnie, but he still didn't see her anywhere.

46
00:02:46.169 --> 00:02:50.290
"Whoa!" cried a voice.

47
00:02:51.211 --> 00:02:54.992
Ben spun around just in time to see a human kid slip and fall.

48
00:02:56.224 --> 00:02:58.046
Jen, the blob, helped him up.

49
00:02:59.286 --> 00:03:01.328
"Sorry, Dave," said Jen.

50
00:03:01.348 --> 00:03:04.430
"My slime trail can be pretty slippery."

51
00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.834
"That's okay, Jen," said Dave with a grin.

52
00:03:08.854 --> 00:03:11.736
"I'll just watch where I step!"

53
00:03:13.137 --> 00:03:16.359
As Jen and Dave danced, Ben looked around for Winnie again.

54
00:03:18.921 --> 00:03:19.622
He saw Mr.

55
00:03:19.702 --> 00:03:22.284
Freaky dancing with a large, red-haired woman.

56
00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.392
"I'm glad you're enjoying yourself, Mrs.

57
00:03:28.432 --> 00:03:30.154
Hubbletree." Mr.

58
00:03:30.234 --> 00:03:32.035
Freaky sounded slightly out of breath.

59
00:03:32.055 --> 00:03:35.838
"I'm having a great time!"

60
00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:37.079
replied Mrs.

61
00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:40.462
Hubbletree. "Thanks again for inviting Mr.

62
00:03:40.522 --> 00:03:41.343
Hubbletree and me.

63
00:03:42.384 --> 00:03:45.126
Unfortunately, my husband doesn't like dancing."

64
00:03:46.187 --> 00:03:48.208
Ben floated past the principal and Mrs.

65
00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:52.052
Hubbletree. And then, at last, he found Winnie.

66
00:03:53.588 --> 00:03:58.049
Her dark hair was long and loose, and she was wearing a beautiful black dress.

67
00:04:02.491 --> 00:04:03.751
dancing with Zork!"

68
00:04:04.151 --> 00:04:05.591
Ben realized with a pang.

69
00:04:06.652 --> 00:04:13.274
His heart sank as the scaly green monster whispered something in Winnie's ear, and she burst out laughing.

70
00:04:17.615 --> 00:04:21.716
When the song ended, Winnie said something to Zork, who then hurried off.

71
00:04:23.232 --> 00:04:24.433
Ben shot over to her.

72
00:04:24.453 --> 00:04:30.178
"Winnie! You'll never believe His words trailed off when he saw the look on her face.

73
00:04:30.198 --> 00:04:32.660
"Where were you?"

74
00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.401
she asked in a low tone.

75
00:04:34.421 --> 00:04:36.183
"I looked everywhere."

76
00:04:36.203 --> 00:04:39.025
"I'm so sorry."

77
00:04:39.246 --> 00:04:40.767
Ben tried to explain again.

78
00:04:40.787 --> 00:04:44.770
"I got here early, while you were getting changed for the dance.

79
00:04:45.691 --> 00:04:48.373
And then Waldo wanted to show me his new experiment."

80
00:04:51.988 --> 00:04:54.851
His chuckle sounded too loud, even to his own ears.

81
00:04:54.871 --> 00:05:00.135
"This is unbelievable, but we got locked inside the science lab."

82
00:05:00.155 --> 00:05:03.558
"What?" He grinned at her.

83
00:05:03.578 --> 00:05:05.759
"Crazy, right?"

84
00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.122
Winnie stared at him without smiling back.

85
00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:11.204
"You're a ghost, Ben.

86
00:05:12.585 --> 00:05:16.829
If you were locked inside the lab, why didn't you just float out through the walls?"

87
00:05:17.289 --> 00:05:18.130
Ben winced.

88
00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:25.341
"I um "I thought you wanted to go to the dance with me," Winnie said.

89
00:05:26.042 --> 00:05:27.402
She wasn't looking at Ben.

90
00:05:27.422 --> 00:05:31.104
"I thought you actually liked me."

91
00:05:31.124 --> 00:05:33.925
"I did," said Ben.

92
00:05:33.945 --> 00:05:35.446
"I mean, I do!

93
00:05:36.466 --> 00:05:40.288
But then we got trapped in the lab, and Ben suddenly had an idea.

94
00:05:40.308 --> 00:05:42.449
"Read my thoughts, Winnie.

95
00:05:43.229 --> 00:05:44.730
You'll see that I'm telling the truth!"

96
00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:46.711
She shook her head.

97
00:05:46.731 --> 00:05:49.292
"I told you before, Ben.

98
00:05:50.364 --> 00:05:52.625
I can read minds only sometimes.

99
00:05:53.865 --> 00:05:57.846
Other times, especially when I'm upset, I can't read them at all.

100
00:05:58.586 --> 00:06:00.947
So I have no idea what you're thinking right now."

101
00:06:02.287 --> 00:06:03.148
Ben sighed.

102
00:06:03.168 --> 00:06:06.028
"I'm really sorry.

103
00:06:07.269 --> 00:06:08.429
I wish you'd believe me.

104
00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:10.790
Can I get you anything?"

105
00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.410
"Thank you," she replied.

106
00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.511
"But Zork is bringing me some iced sludge."

107
00:06:17.572 --> 00:06:18.892
Ben looked at her pleadingly.

108
00:06:20.368 --> 00:06:22.290
"I'm supposed to be your date tonight, Winnie.

109
00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:26.513
Can't we just, I don't know, start over or something?"

110
00:06:27.474 --> 00:06:30.816
Just then Zork appeared with two cups of iced sludge.

111
00:06:30.836 --> 00:06:33.098
"Hey, Ben," said Zork.

112
00:06:34.339 --> 00:06:35.320
"Great dance, huh?"

113
00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.702
He handed one of the cups to Winnie.

114
00:06:37.722 --> 00:06:42.926
"Oh yeah," said Ben, forcing a laugh.

115
00:06:43.586 --> 00:06:44.827
"I'm having a blast."
